  data: {
    LLM: 'Players alternate turning the top card of their packet face up onto a central pile. Normal cards (non-attack): no action, play passes to opponent. Attack cards (A, 2, 3): opponent must play 1, 2, or 3 cards respectively. If all response cards are normal, attacker takes the entire pile and places it face down under their packet. If opponent plays an attack card during response, the original attack is cancelled and the new attack takes effect (the previous attacker must now respond). Continue until one player runs out of cards.',
    Player: 'Players alternate turning the top card of their packet face up onto a central pile. Normal cards (non-attack): no action, play passes to opponent. Attack cards (A, 2, 3): opponent must play 1, 2, or 3 cards respectively. If all response cards are normal, attacker takes the entire pile and places it face down under their packet. If opponent plays an attack card during response, the original attack is cancelled and the new attack takes effect (the previous attacker must now respond). Continue until one player runs out of cards.',
    objective: 'Win all the cards. The player who runs out of cards loses.',
    gameplay: 'Players alternate turning the top card of their packet face up onto a central pile. Normal cards (non-attack): no action, play passes to opponent. Attack cards (A, 2, 3): opponent must play 1, 2, or 3 cards respectively. If all response cards are normal, attacker takes the entire pile and places it face down under their packet. If opponent plays an attack card during response, the original attack is cancelled and the new attack takes effect (the previous attacker must now respond). Continue until one player runs out of cards.',
